BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sunny-2026-11-29@maple-tracker
DTSTAMP:20261129T000000Z
DTSTART:20261129T000000Z
DTEND:20261130T000000Z
SUMMARY:Sunny Sunday
DESCRIPTION:50% off Ability resets\nTreasure Hunter EXP x3\n50% off Spell T
 race Enhancements\n1+1 Star Force upon a successful enhancement at 10-Star
  or below.\nCan reach up to 12 Stars. Excludes Superior Equipment.\n+250% 
 Monster Park Clear EXP\nDoes not apply to the Extreme Monster Parker quest
 .\n[HEXA Matrix] When Main Stat is Lv. 5+\, the enhancement chance is incr
 eased 20%.\nMultiplied by the existing enhancement chance.\n5x chance to g
 et Magnificent Soul from Soul Shards\n+100% chance to register a new monst
 er in Monster Collection\nMysterious Monsterbloom (x3): Untradable\, Perma
 nent .\nCan be claimed 1 time per account.\nSelect ‘Special Sunny Sunday
  Gifts for All’ from the Event List and click ‘Participate’ to claim
 . Can be claimed until November 29\, 2026 at 11:59 PM UTC.\nCannot be clai
 med in Challenger World.\nElite monster appearance increase\nElite Monster
 s summoned by a Rune of Darkness or when an Elite Boss appears are not aff
 ected.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
