DTSTAMP:20261206T000000Z
DTSTART:20261206T000000Z
DTEND:20261207T000000Z
SUMMARY:Sunny Sunday: 30% off Star Force enhancements
DESCRIPTION:Shining Star Force Time\n30% off Star Force enhancements\nMesos
  used to safeguard are not eligible for the 30% discount.\n30% reduced cha
 nce of item destruction when enhancing items at 21 Stars or below\n2x Sol 
 Erda when hunting\nSol Erda obtained through other methods is not increase
 d.\n+250% Monster Park Clear EXP\nDoes not apply to the Extreme Monster Pa
 rker quest.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
